@Rail.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5166
@stationId = tajrish
@destinationId = farhangsara
@serviceDate = 2026-11-08

### Start Google login (run the API's HTTPS profile; open authorizationUrl in a browser)
POST https://localhost:7130/api/authentication/google/start

### Exchange after Google login (paste values from start; 202 means still pending)
POST https://localhost:7130/api/authentication/google/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "PASTE_SESSION_ID",
  "exchangeKey": "PASTE_EXCHANGE_KEY"
}

### Start linking Google to the signed-in Rail account
POST https://localhost:7130/api/authentication/google/link/start
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Lines and route identifiers
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/network/lines

### Ordered stops on a route
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/network/routes/line-1-main

### Operational map segments
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/network/segments?operationalOnly=true

### Station search and facilities
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations?q=tajrish&operationalOnly=true

###
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}

### Closest stations by straight-line distance
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations/nearby?latitude=35.8&longitude=51.43&limit=5

### Scheduled departures for a Tehran service date
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}/departures?date={{serviceDate}}&after=08:00

### Earliest scheduled arrival within the search window
# Local times are in Tehran. Legs is null if no journey fits the window.
# Missing transfer rules use the fallback time, in minutes, and are labeled in the response.
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/navigation/journeys?fromStationId={{stationId}}&toStationId={{destinationId}}&date={{serviceDate}}&after=08:00&searchHours=6&fallbackTransferMinutes=5

### Timetable groups
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/schedule-groups?lineId=1

### Trips scheduled for one group and service date
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/schedule-groups/2/trips?date={{serviceDate}}&after=08:00&limit=10

### Service calendar for a Tehran date
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/service-calendar?date={{serviceDate}}

### Published alerts affecting a station
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/service-alerts?stationId={{stationId}}&includeUpcoming=true

### Fare catalog with effective prices in rials
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/fares?date={{serviceDate}}

### List favorites (set RAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN to an access token from login)
GET {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/favorite-stations
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Save a station to favorites
PUT {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/favorite-stations/{{stationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Remove a favorite
DELETE {{Rail.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/favorite-stations/{{stationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv RAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
